न चैनं क्ल‍ेदयन्त्यापो न शोषयति मारुतः ॥ २३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":619,\"bb\":562,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/23/b562/\",\"body_value\":\"nainaṁ chindanti śastrāṇi
nainaṁ dahati pāvakaḥ
na cainaṁ kledayanty āpo
na śoṣayati mārutaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":620,\"bb\":563,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/23/b563/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – never; enam – this soul; chindanti – can cut to pieces; śastrāṇi – weapons; na – never; enam – this soul; dahati – burns; pāvakaḥ – fire; na – never; ca – also; enam – this soul; kledayanti – moistens; āpaḥ – water; na – never; śoṣayati – dries; mārutaḥ – wind.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"enam\",\"translation\":\"this soul\"},{\"word\":\"chindanti\",\"translation\":\"can cut to pieces\"},{\"word\":\"śastrāṇi\",\"translation\":\"weapons\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"enam\",\"translation\":\"this soul\"},{\"word\":\"dahati\",\"translation\":\"burns\"},{\"word\":\"pāvakaḥ\",\"translation\":\"fire\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"enam\",\"translation\":\"this soul\"},{\"word\":\"kledayanti\",\"translation\":\"moistens\"},{\"word\":\"āpaḥ\",\"translation\":\"water\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"śoṣayati\",\"translation\":\"dries\"},{\"word\":\"mārutaḥ\",\"translation\":\"wind\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":621,\"bb\":564,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/23/b564/\",\"body_value\":\"The soul can never be cut to pieces by any weapon, nor burned by fire, nor moistened by water, nor withered by the wind.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":622,\"bb\":565,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/23/b565/\",\"body_value\":\"All kinds of weapons – swords, flame weapons, rain weapons, tornado weapons, etc. – are unable to kill the spirit soul. It appears that there were many kinds of weapons made of earth, water, air, ether, etc., in addition to the modern weapons of fire. Even the nuclear weapons of the modern age are classified as fire weapons, but formerly there were other weapons made of all different types of material elements. Fire weapons were counteracted by water weapons, which are now unknown to modern science. Nor do modern scientists have knowledge of tornado weapons. Nonetheless, the soul can never be cut into pieces, nor annihilated by any number of weapons, regardless of scientific devices.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":623,\"bb\":566,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/23/b566/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 2.23\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 2.23\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li